# License

## The deck box design

Derived from **"Parametric Scifi Deck Box With Two Netrunner Emblems"** by
Thingiverse user **Austin** — <https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:39997> — which
is licensed **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike**. The original listing
does not state a version.

This repository is a derivative work and is released under the same terms:
**Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike** — <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>

That covers `src/deckbox.scad`, the `files/deckbox_*.stl` it exports, and the renders
in `images/renders/`.

## The organizer

`src/organizer.scad` and the `files/organizer_*.stl` it exports are remixed from
**"Netrunner NSG Organizer"** on MakerWorld — <https://makerworld.com/models/2956774> —
which is licensed **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike**.
They are released under the same terms:
<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/>

The geometry was rebuilt from measurements of the original. None of its meshes
are included.

